    "sections": {
        "description": "A content-first block theme for writers, publishers, and review sites. Osmium puts the design in theme.json and the layout in patterns, so it ships no JavaScript of its own and stays out of the way of your words. Includes 22 templates, 138 patterns with a full review kit and pages from four sample sites, and six designs that restyle every one of them."
